# Arms and Equipment Guide objects that Races of Faerun (35e) also define(s) (3.5 reprint): loaded only when none of those books is loaded.
Snowshoes																																	TYPE:Goods.General																				COST:15	WT:8																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.25																									SPROP:These allow the wearer to move at 2/3 normal speed across snow and ice. Snowshoes take 1 minute to don and a full-round action to remove.
Spear of Impaling	PROFICIENCY:WEAPON|Longspear	TYPE:Container.Magic.Enhancement.Weapon.Melee.TwoHanded.Simple.Reach.Specific.Piercing.Spear	CONTAINS:UNLIM|Weapon Crystal=1	COST:5	WT:9	CRITMULT:x3	CRITRANGE:1	DAMAGE:1d8	EQMOD:MAGIC_COST|24000.Masterwork (Weapon).PLUS2W.STEEL.WOOD	WIELD:TwoHanded	REACHMULT:2	SIZE:M	SOURCELONG:Magic Item Compendium	SOURCESHORT:MIC	SOURCEPAGE:p.117	SPROP:On a critical hit, the victim is run through. The wielder may make a grapple attempt as a free action. If this succeeds, the wielder may then make a pin attempt as a free action. An opposed grapple check can be made to break the pin or grapple.
